  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-SPELL-DEATH-180-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "See? I knew you were fine. When the others found out you left, they were all 'ah, the Wizard's gone renegade. They'll get themselves killed.'",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Duncan_Grimwater_DM-SPELL_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700145,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-SPELL-DEATH-180-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And I said 'that's nuts, they'll just come back more heroic than ever.' Then they said: 'Duncan, go teach them secret Cabal magic or something.'",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Duncan_Grimwater_DM-SPELL_007.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700145,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-SPELL-DEATH-180-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And so here I am.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Duncan_Grimwater_DM-SPELL_008.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700145,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-SPELL-DEATH-180-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I don't know any secret Cabal magic.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Duncan_Grimwater_DM-SPELL_009.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700145,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-SPELL-DEATH-180-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "*SIGH* So how's the revenge trip going?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Duncan_Grimwater_DM-SPELL_010.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700145,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-SPELL-DEATH-180-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Oh, wait, no, yes, no, OH! I do know something. Uhhh... Caro et anima, aether et substantia, tarocchi et Spell Cards.'",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Duncan_Grimwater_DM-SPELL_011.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700145,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-SPELL-DEATH-180-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "That's a little invocation to help you harness the lost power of Darkmoor to make a new Death Spell, specifically: Death.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Duncan_Grimwater_DM-SPELL_012.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700145,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-SPELL-DEATH-180-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You know, like the fortunetelling card Death. It means change or stagnation, depending how it's played. The Cabal thought they could use it.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Duncan_Grimwater_DM-SPELL_013.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700145,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-SPELL-DEATH-180-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Thus the invocation. It will give you your spell form, meaning and energy... once we do some things.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Duncan_Grimwater_DM-SPELL_014.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700145,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-SPELL-DEATH-180-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Starting with form... what does Death look like? Scratch that, he's actually not that intimidating. Let's just make a pure vampire spell.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Duncan_Grimwater_DM-SPELL_015.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700145,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-SPELL-DEATH-180-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Death represents change. Played reversed, it means resistance, rotting, decay. So I think we can kill two bats here, create form and meaning...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Duncan_Grimwater_DM-SPELL_016.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700145,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-SPELL-DEATH-180-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...By using something called Shadow Photomancy to record vampire history in the Mortal Plain. Shadow Photomancy is a technique whereby-",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Duncan_Grimwater_DM-SPELL_017.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700145,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-SPELL-DEATH-180-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Oh, you know it already. Fine. Go use it then.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Duncan_Grimwater_DM-SPELL_018.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700145,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
